  "goodToKnow": "Unzumutbar means unreasonable or unacceptable to expect of someone: unzumutbare Zustände, eine unzumutbare Belastung. It's also a legal term: in German social law, a job offer can be unzumutbar for a jobseeker. Zumuten means to expect something (too much) of someone, and die Zumutung is an imposition: Das ist eine Zumutung! Synonyms: untragbar, inakzeptabel."
